[[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/comments/373279463","html_url":"https://github.com/open5gs/open5gs/issues/36#issuecomment-373279463","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/36","id":373279463,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDM3MzI3OTQ2Mw==","user":{"login":"acetcom","id":4222492,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyMjI0OTI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4222492?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom","html_url":"https://github.com/acetcom","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2018-03-15T06:55:15Z","updated_at":"2018-03-15T06:55:15Z","body":"Hi, laps4111wu\r\n\r\nCould you see [the configuration guide](http://nextepc.org/guides/3-configuration/)?\r\n\r\nYou may need to set the following configuration in your ubuntu machine.\r\n\r\nIf you have no NAT router, there is another option for you. iptables can solve the problem. You execute the following command in NextEPC installed host. The eth0 shown below is just an example. Do not miss out on modifying your interface name(e.g enp0s25, wls3).\r\n```\r\nsudo sh -c \"echo 1 > /proc/sys/net/ipv4/ip_forward\"\r\nsudo iptables -t nat -A POSTROUTING -o eth0 -j MASQUERADE\r\nsudo iptables -I INPUT -i pgwtun -j ACCEPT\r\n```\r\n\r\nThanks!","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/comments/373279463/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/comments/373287351","html_url":"https://github.com/open5gs/open5gs/issues/36#issuecomment-373287351","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/36","id":373287351,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDM3MzI4NzM1MQ==","user":{"login":"lsps4111wu","id":17041421,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MDQxNDIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17041421?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lsps4111wu","html_url":"https://github.com/lsps4111wu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lsps4111wu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lsps4111wu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lsps4111wu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lsps4111wu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lsps4111wu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lsps4111wu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lsps4111wu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lsps4111wu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lsps4111wu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2018-03-15T07:37:28Z","updated_at":"2018-03-15T07:37:50Z","body":"Hi, \r\nThanks for your reply\r\nLet me verify my idea\r\nThe IP in my computer that use to surf Internet is 192.168.101.134 \r\nand I find that it go through a D-Link router\r\nSo that means I have NAT router?\r\n\r\nThanks!","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/comments/373287351/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"