 environment.\r\n\r\nThanks!\r\n\r\n\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/comments/374949342/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/comments/375156853","html_url":"https://github.com/open5gs/open5gs/issues/36#issuecomment-375156853","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/36","id":375156853,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDM3NTE1Njg1Mw==","user":{"login":"lsps4111wu","id":17041421,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MDQxNDIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17041421?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lsps4111wu","html_url":"https://github.com/lsps4111wu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lsps4111wu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lsps4111wu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lsps4111wu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lsps4111wu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lsps4111wu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lsps4111wu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lsps4111wu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lsps4111wu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lsps4111wu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2018-03-22T02:19:32Z","updated_at":"2018-03-22T03:42:33Z","body":"Hi,\r\nI allow only 3 femtocells(10.102.0.226 & 228 & 236) to connect to EPC.\r\nThe following files are: \r\n[nextepc.log](https://github.com/acetcom/nextepc/files/1835934/nextepc.log)\r\n[0322_3xfemtocell_with_J7_walk.pcapng.zip](https://github.com/acetcom/nextepc/files/1835935/0322_3xfemtocell_with_J7_walk.pcapng.zip)\r\n\r\nT